 "description": "Run a raw SoQL query against any San Francisco open-data resource (data.sfgov.org) by its Socrata id (8-char like \"wg3w-h783\"). Full SoQL: where/select/group/order/limit/offset. Use sf_datasets to find a resource id, or sf_recent for the common ones.",
